  "body": "Restores `assets/ui/cube.png`, which v0.19.0's `release.yml` linux and macos jobs failed on, and adds a check so it cannot recur.\n\n**Culprit.** Commit 6792a8a3f (\"original icons for tool kinds, tree rows...\"), #661 slice 2, merged by PR #1179, deleted the file. Five packaging scripts still read it. The app itself does not load it, and no other icon in `assets/ui` is above 32 px, so nothing larger exists to point the scripts at.\n\n**Change.**\n- `assets/ui/cube.png`: restored byte for byte from `v0.18.0` (our own original, 240 x 240).\n- Script lines changed: none. `release.yml` changed: none. No trigger added. Readers that now resolve again: `scripts/package-appimage.sh:57`, `scripts/package-flatpak.sh:45`, `scripts/package-linux.sh:66`, `scripts/package-macos.sh:53,58`, `scripts/package-snap.sh:33`.\n- `xtask/src/package_paths_tests.rs` (new, wired in `xtask/src/main.rs`): reads `scripts/package-*.sh` and `release.yml` as text; fails on any OS when a literal `assets/...` path or a copied asset directory is missing. Checked red by removing the file (all five scripts reported), green with it.\n- `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` 56 -> 57 (xtask is a process file). PR #1426 also takes 57; expect a one-line conflict, the second to merge takes the next number.\n- Decision: `docs/decisions/1428-restore-cube-icon.md`.\n\n**Tested.** `cargo test -p xtask package_paths` (3 pass), `cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n\n**Not exercised.** The Linux and macOS packaging itself (needs those OSes); no Actions run triggered, tag and release untouched.\n\nChangelog: fix: restore the launcher icon the Linux and macOS packages install; xtask test pins packaging asset paths (#1428)\nEffort: medium (issue labelled low; touches several packaging scripts' inputs). Escalated: no.\n\nFixes #1428\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
